                           nrules vsegs_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LA1LD_0RA1LD vis_1RB0LD_1RC1RA_1LA1LD_0RA1LD
                           [0] 1).
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
