  d < fm_b FAM - 1 -> r < 0 + 1 ->
  ReachL tm (negb (fm_left FAM)) (fm_left FAM)
    (lr_lhs (iarm_1RB1LB_1LC1LD_0LA1RC_1LB0RC d r)) (lr_rhs (iarm_1RB1LB_1LC1LD_0LA1RC_1LB0RC d r)).
Proof.
  intros d r Hd Hr. vm_compute in Hd.
